  col @29,653,682,179
    h2 TPAC 2026 @29,653,682,21
    text TPAC 2026, our major hybrid event of the year, gathers our community on 26-30 October, in Dublin, Ireland. @29,686,682,41
    text During this exciting week, W3C work groups meet to coordinate work that advances web standardization. TPAC also brings together the W3C governing bodies (Board of Directors, Advisory Board, Technical Architecture Group and the W3C Advisory Committee). @29,739,682,61
    link "Visit the TPAC 2026 website" https://www.w3.org/news-events/tpac/2026/ @29,812,682,20
