    h2 Web standards @17,844,694,21
    text Web standards are the building blocks of a consistent digitally connected world. They are implemented in browsers, blogs, search engines, and other software that power our experience on the web. @17,877,694,41
    text W3C is an international community where , full-time , and the public work together to develop web standards. @17,930,694,40
